As per final order,
 for the following;
 REASONS 10. Issue No.1:- In order to explain the actionable negligence of the driver of Bolero City Pick up vehicle bearing Reg.No.TN-12-AL-5643, the P.W.1 has filed her affidavit explaining the vivid picture of the accident that took place on 06-10-2024 at about 04-30 pm., when the petitioner was traveling in a Car bearing Reg.No.KA-04- ND-6489 as an occupant and when the said car was reached near Vijayapura- Jaipura Bridge, BM bypass road, Ramanagara Tq & District, at that time the driver of Bolero City Pick up vehicle bearing Reg.No.TN-12-AL- 5643 came in a rash and negligent manner, suddenly stopped his vehicle in the middle of the road, due to that, the driver of the vehicle in which petitioner was traveling dashed to Bolero vehicle, result of which the petitioner sustained grievous injuries.
